WEBVTT


00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.720
What’s your favourite curse word?

00:00:01.780 --> 00:00:04.740
I like to do a portmanteau curse word

00:00:04.741 --> 00:00:06.320
So, um

00:00:06.380 --> 00:00:07.300
Fuck, cunt

00:00:07.301 --> 00:00:10.560
Like, I like to add them together and really hammer it home
